    <h3><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="spill-update-118521">11/4/2026 - Met Council responded to wastewater spill in Eagan</button></h3>
  </div>
  <div class="ec_content" id="spill-update-118521">
    Crews completed repairs of the failed infrastructure and cleaned the affected area early this morning, Wednesday, November 4. No waterbodies were impacted by the spill.<br />
&nbsp;
